# Generated / binary media — keep out of Git history
# Text, source, configuration, documentation, and other human-readable artifacts remain trackable.

# Images
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.heic
*.heif
*.avif

# Audio
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.m4a
*.aac
*.opus
*.wma

# Video
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wmv
*.mpeg
*.mpg

# Other common binary media / archives
*.ico
*.pdf
